---- eig / eigvals
ok   eig(5x5 non-symmetric): eigenvalues match mpmath.eig at 50 digits (nearest-neighbour matching)  (max |dw| 1.1e-15; np dtype complex128)
ok   eig: A v_i = w_i v_i for every column
ok   eig: eigenvectors have unit 2-norm (documented 'normalized (unit length)')
ok   eigvals equals the eigenvalues from mpmath (same nearest-neighbour test)
ok   eig of a real rotation: complex128 output, eigenvalues +-i in conjugate pairs (documented 'occur in conjugate pairs')
