ok   lstsq rcond=None: cut-off eps * max(M,N) = 8 eps = 1.8e-15 (documented 'machine precision times max(M, N)'): s3 = 3e-16 counts as zero -> rank 2; rcond=-1 (eps only) -> rank 3  (s = ['1.00e+00', '1.00e-03', '2.93e-16'])
