ok   stack (2,3,4,4) eigvalsh: result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 3.5e-16)
ok   stack (2,3,4,4) svd s: result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 3.5e-16)
ok   stack (2,3,4,4) qr |diag R|: result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 2.3e-16)
ok   stack (2,3,4,4) cholesky: result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 2.7e-16)
ok   stack (2,3,4,4) pinv: result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 1.3e-15)
ok   stack (2,3,4,4) cond: result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 1.6e-15)
ok   stack (2,3,4,4) norm(axis=(-2,-1), 'nuc'): result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 2.1e-16)
ok   stack (2,3,4,4) matrix_power 3: result[i,j] equals the mpmath value for matrix [i,j] (2-level stack)  (worst rel diff 2.7e-16)
